---
---
<section id="download" class="mx-auto max-w-6xl px-6 py-16 sm:py-24">
  <div class="relative overflow-hidden rounded-[36px] border border-mist bg-gradient-to-br from-ink via-ink to-teal-dark px-6 py-12 text-center text-white sm:px-12 sm:py-16">
    <div class="absolute -left-20 top-10 h-64 w-64 rounded-full bg-teal/30 blur-[120px]"></div>
    <div class="absolute -right-16 bottom-0 h-72 w-72 rounded-full bg-coral/20 blur-[140px]"></div>
    <div class="relative mx-auto flex max-w-3xl flex-col items-center gap-6">
      <img src="/logo.svg" alt="Meu Ponto" class="h-16 w-16" />
      <div class="flex flex-col gap-4">
        <h2 class="text-3xl font-semibold tracking-tight sm:text-4xl md:text-5xl">Baixe o Meu Ponto</h2>
        <p class="text-lg text-white/80 sm:text-xl">
          Disponível para Android. Baixe o APK oficial dos GitHub Releases ou acompanhe o código fonte.
        </p>
      </div>
      <div class="flex flex-wrap items-center justify-center gap-4">
        <a
          href="https://github.com/eibragaa/meu-ponto-android/releases/latest"
          class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 rounded-pill bg-white px-8 py-3 text-base font-medium text-ink transition hover:bg-mint"
        >
          Baixar APK (GitHub Releases)
        </a>
        <a
          href="https://play.google.com/store/search?q=Meu%20Ponto&c=apps"
          class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 rounded-pill border border-white/40 px-8 py-3 text-base font-medium text-white transition hover:bg-white/10"
        >
          Google Play (em breve)
        </a>
      </div>
      <p class="text-sm text-white/60">Flavor github com atualizador in-app • Flavor play otimizado para a Play Store</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
